  "id": "depersonalization-disorder",
  "term": "depersonalization disorder",
  "definition": "Depersonalization disorder is a mental condition marked by ongoing or repeated episodes of feeling detached from oneself, such as from one’s body or mental processes. During these experiences, the person still recognizes that the sense of unreality is only a feeling and not actually true.",
